Package: slate-facetimehd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Slate <slate@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-amd64, curl, xz-utils, cpio, ca-certificates
Description: FaceTime HD camera driver for MacBooks (Slate)
 The facetimehd driver (github.com/patjak/facetimehd), built with DKMS, plus
 the camera firmware. Apple's firmware can't be redistributed, so it is
 downloaded from Apple's update server during installation (about 18 MB) and
 checked against known SHA-256 checksums.
